-- (the whole file is one transaction). A function that is not on this database is skipped. Grants, owner and settings are kept (create or replace).
-- What a person sees when two asks race at the limit: the first is accepted, the second is refused in words ("There are already 5 place questions waiting for an answer. Wait for those first." or the 100-a-day sentence).
